<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5406" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμολγ-αῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμέλγω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>made with milk,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾶζα ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					590
				</span></i>
			; also expl. as 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκμαία</span>
			 (from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμολγός,</span> Achaean for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκμή</span>), bread <i>of the best
				flour,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				3.115a
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1018.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>full of milk,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαστός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.657
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
